{
    "chapter_num": 7,
    "verses_count": 37,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Defilement Comes from Within"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the Pharisees and some of the scribes came together to Him, having come from Jerusalem. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits when"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "when they saw some of His disciples eat bread with defiled, that is, with unwashed hands, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits they found fault"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "they found fault. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For the Pharisees and all the Jews do not eat unless they wash "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "their"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " hands "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. with the fist"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "in a special way, holding the tradition of the elders. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "When they come"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " from the marketplace, they do not eat unless they wash. And there are many other things which they have received and hold, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "like"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the washing of cups, pitchers, copper vessels, and couches."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the Pharisees and scribes asked Him, “Why do Your disciples not walk according to the tradition of the elders, but eat bread with unwashed hands?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He answered and said to them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Well did Isaiah prophesy of you"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "hypocrites, as it is written:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "‘This people honors Me with their lips,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "But their heart is far from Me."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "And in vain they worship Me,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Teaching as doctrines the commandments of men.’"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "For laying aside the commandment of God, you hold the tradition of men—"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits the rest of v. 8."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "the washing of pitchers and cups, and many other such things you do.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He said to them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“All too well"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "you"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "set aside"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "reject the commandment of God, that you may keep your tradition."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "For Moses said,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "‘Honor your father and your mother’; and,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "‘He who curses father or mother, let him be put to death.’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "But you say, ‘If a man says to his father or mother,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Whatever profit you might have received from me is Corban”—’ (that is, a gift to God),"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "then you no longer let him do anything for his father or his mother,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "making the word of God of no effect through your tradition which you have handed down. And many such things you do.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When He had called all the multitude to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Himself,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " He said to them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Hear Me, everyone, and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "understand:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "There is nothing that enters a man from outside which can defile him; but the things which come out of him, those are the things that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "defile a man."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "If"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits v. 16."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "anyone has ears to hear, let him hear!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When He had entered a house away from the crowd, His disciples asked Him concerning the parable. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So He said to them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Are you thus without understanding also? Do you not perceive that whatever enters a man from outside cannot defile him,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "because it does not enter his heart but his stomach, and is eliminated,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU sets off the final phrase as Mark’s comment that Jesus has declared all foods clean."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "thus purifying all foods?”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And He said, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“What comes out of a man, that defiles a man."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "For from within, out of the heart of men,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "proceed evil thoughts,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "adulteries,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "fornications, murders,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "thefts,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "covetousness, wickedness,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "deceit,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "lewdness, an evil eye,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "blasphemy,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "pride, foolishness."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "All these evil things come from within and defile a man.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "A Gentile Shows Her Faith"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "From there He arose and went to the region of Tyre "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits and Sidon"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and Sidon. And He entered a house and wanted no one to know "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " but He could not be hidden. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For a woman whose young daughter had an unclean spirit heard about Him, and she came and fell at His feet. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The woman was a "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Gentile"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Greek, a "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "A Syrian of Phoenicia"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Syro-Phoenician by birth, and she kept "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "begging"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "asking Him to cast the demon out of her daughter. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But Jesus said to her, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Let the children be filled first, for it is not good to take the children’s bread and throw it to the little dogs.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And she answered and said to Him, “Yes, Lord, yet even the little dogs under the table eat from the children’s crumbs.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then He said to her, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“For this saying go your way; the demon has gone out of your daughter.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when she had come to her house, she found the demon gone out, and her daughter lying on the bed."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Jesus Heals a Deaf-Mute"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Again, departing from the region of Tyre and Sidon, He came through the midst of the region of Decapolis to the Sea of Galilee. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then they brought to Him one who was deaf and had an impediment in his speech, and they begged Him to put His hand on him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And He took him aside from the multitude, and put His fingers in his ears, and He spat and touched his tongue. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 34,
                    "num_str": "34",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then, looking up to heaven, He sighed, and said to him, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Ephphatha,”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " that is, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Be opened.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 35,
                    "num_str": "35",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Immediately his ears were opened, and the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. bond"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "impediment of his tongue was loosed, and he spoke plainly. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 36,
                    "num_str": "36",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then He commanded them that they should tell no one; but the more He commanded them, the more widely they proclaimed "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 37,
                    "num_str": "37",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they were astonished beyond measure, saying, “He has done all things well. He makes both the deaf to hear and the mute to speak.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}